   {
    "claim": "On 096988dd, shifting the cars +2 s at 1.25x speed made every run fail. Each time the policy steered left against a STRAIGHT/RIGHT command and its front hit the car beside it in the left lane. This is a confirmed failure caused by the policy.",
    "settings": [
