    "settings": [
     "S28"
    ]
   },
   {
    "claim": "The code counts 023b7fcc at \u22122 s and 1.5x as confirmed, but none of its failures were the policy's. A replayed car behind was already in rear contact before handoff, and that contact was scored as a side collision at the moment the policy took over. The brief says to ignore rear-end hits, so this case should not count.",
    "settings": [
     "S2"
    ]
   },
   {
    "claim": "The code counts 1c45ce3a at 0 s and 0.75x as confirmed, but the ego kept its lane and slowed gently each time. The retimed cut-in car (track 14) passed on the right and cut left into the ego's front-right corner. Triage judged these failures not the policy's fault, or unclear, so whether the ego could have avoided them is open.",
    "settings": [
     "S32"
