  "open": [
   "Only two scenes (S11, S28) are confirmed failures caused by the policy. To find a third, repeat 09a95ffa at 0 s and 1.25x (S12) and 023b7fcc at +1 s and 1.5x (S4) until each range separates from one half.",
   "Fix or exclude the setups where boxes already overlap before handoff (023b7fcc at \u22122 s; 09a95ffa at +1.5\u20132 s; 096988dd at +2 s and 0.75x) and rerun them. Today their failures say nothing about the policy, and the artifact flag missed them.",
